This package includes substantial code adapted from deepseek-ai/chat-demo at
5d5dd754ebc1948e977ddb880a9eb5aa25f37b4c (v0.1.1), licensed below.

Scope of the adaptation (as of 0.9.0-rc.8):

- The React client under `client/src/` is a derivative of the official demo's
  client: a large part of the base/markdown/search UI components, their CSS
  modules, markdown services, i18n infrastructure and utility modules are
  taken from or adapted from the upstream sources; conversation-specific
  screens (session list, chat input, message list, settings, import/export)
  are heavily modified extensions of the upstream files.
- The wire-protocol core in the workspace package `@dsh-chat/shared`
  (`packages/chat-shared/src/chat/` and `packages/chat-shared/src/protocol/`)
  is ported from the upstream demo; the affected files carry a source note in
  their headers.
- Two client modules are directly adapted and additionally noted in their
  headers: the history ZIP reader (`src/host/archive-zip.ts`) and the
  microphone recorder (`client/src/services/speech/recorder.ts`).
- Some host-side fragments are likewise derived from upstream files: the
  system-prompt constant in `src/host/turns.ts` (from the upstream store), the
  archive v3 export/validation logic in `src/host/archive.ts` (from the
  upstream history export code), and `src/host/demo-reminder.ts` (adapted from
  the upstream latestReminder module).

The remainder of this package — the DSH host integration, local retrieval
engine, settings/appearance system, DSH session persistence glue, the
`client.js` module bootstrap, and all build configuration — is original work
of this project. WebChat is an independent community project and is not an
official DeepSeek product.

